Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The psychology of money by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Morgan Housel in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people believe getting rich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is about finance formulas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,spreadsheets, and being a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In reality, money is not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,a science. It is a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,psychological mirror. Ronald Reid was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,an ordinary janitor who quietly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,saved modest wages into index
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,funds. When he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he left behind $8,000,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Richard Fosconi was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Harvard educated Wall Street executive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,who borrowed heavily,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,built a mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.95,0:00:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and went completely bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Financial success is not about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It is about how you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,behave. First, beware the man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.49,0:00:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,in the car paradox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see someone driving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.45,0:00:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,a Ferrari, you almost never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,think, wow. Look at that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,driver. You think,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.19,0:00:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,if I had that car,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone would admire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the paradox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.15,0:00:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They are only imagining themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Rich as current income and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,spent money. Fast cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,luxury watches, and massive mortgages.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wealth is what you do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,not see. It is unspent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,cash, financial options,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and the quiet freedom to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,say no. Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,understand confounding compounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Warren Buffett is famous as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the world's greatest investor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but his real superpower is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.58,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,not intelligence. It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Over 99% of his wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,was accumulated after his 50
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,birthday. Compounding works like a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,snowball rolling down an endless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.85,0:01:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,mountain. The math only explodes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,if you let the snowball
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.61,0:01:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,roll for decades without stepping
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.65,0:01:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That leads to the ultimate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,rule, room for error.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important part of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,any financial plan is planning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for your plan not going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Survival is the only math
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.81,0:01:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that matters. If you risk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what you need to chase
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,what you do not need,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,one bad crash will wipe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you out completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, master the goalpost of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,enough. If your expectations rise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,with every dollar you earn,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.59,0:02:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you will run on a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.55,0:02:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,hedonic treadmill forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,True wealth is not buying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,luxury toys to impress strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,True wealth is the ability
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to wake up every morning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.64,0:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and say, I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever I want today with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,whoever I want for as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you rather have $10,000,000
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,in the bank but work
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,ninety hours a week for
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,a brutal boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,or have $100,000 but own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,every single second of your
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,time?
